sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor owner as Owner
  participant agg as Acting aggregator
  participant adv as Reference advisors
  participant tools as Tools
  participant gate as Approval gate
  owner->>agg: request
  agg->>adv: trimmed task state, in parallel
  adv-->>agg: analysis and risks, no tool calls
  agg->>tools: read, inspect, calculate, build
  tools-->>agg: result
  alt side effect requested
    agg->>gate: stage action
    gate->>owner: ask explicit approval
    owner->>gate: approve or reject
  else read-only work
    agg-->>owner: verified result
  end
